summary.label:
The program is designed to create a pedigree animal. Maintain a list of animals, their photos and videos. 
Program features: 
- the list of animals;
- construction pedigree animals (2D, 3D);
- construction branch of animal ancestry (2D, 3D);
- the list of generation;
- Drawing calendar family of events;
- making general and personal photo album;
- making general and personal video archive;
- making general and personal archive files;
- storing data in the archive.
